{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想每天拿起手機就知道接下來要做甚麼，不必逐一開啟應用程式？Calpaper 是一款把當日行程化成鎖屏桌布的 iOS 工具，特別適合行程緊密、重視私隱，又不想被通知打擾的上班族與學生。它會讀取 iPhone 上已設定的 iCloud、Google、Outlook 等日曆，原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-194.webp\">\n<h2>鎖屏即見今日行程</h2>\n<p>Calpaper 把今日行程直接繪製成鎖屏桌布，日曆事件的時間、標題與顏色一目瞭然，還可加入提醒短句、備註與倒數日子。十種色調與四款字體、Emoji 位置皆可調整，各區塊能重排或隱藏。資料只在裝置上處理，無需帳戶；配合 iOS 捷徑一次性設定後，每天早上自動更新。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-217-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-218-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-219-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-220-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-221-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-222-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Calpaper: Today at a Glance</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T14:39:30.161474+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":362,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T14:34:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T16:18:41.399265+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T14:38:03.238319+00:00","content_hash":"f8ce15418d77cc4942f12e59533827fa6afe8c5484ec90fe9cd53ed57e59430b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}